// A booted, laid-out editor: ed_t_boot with one frame's layout computed, so a
// case can read real pane rects (ed_rq) instead of the zeroes ui_rect answers
// for a name nothing has drawn yet.
ed_t_lay() {
  ed_lay();
} return void;
